WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:31.291
In the previous verse,

2
00:00:31.291 --> 00:00:36.166
Lord Krishna, showing sensitivity
 toward Arjuna, accepted

3
00:00:36.166 --> 00:00:39.958
that undoubtedly control
 over the mind is difficult.

4
00:00:39.958 --> 00:00:41.708
After that,

5
00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:43.250
he inspired Arjuna toward the path of

6
00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:45.833
practice and detachment.

7
00:00:45.833 --> 00:00:48.416
Now in this verse, taking 
that same matter forward,

8
00:00:48.416 --> 00:00:49.500
he is both

9
00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:51.791
encouraging Arjuna

10
00:00:51.791 --> 00:00:53.833
and cautioning him.

11
00:00:58.583 --> 00:01:00.958
In this verse, Lord Krishna says:

12
00:01:00.958 --> 00:01:03.708
Yoga is difficult for those people

13
00:01:03.708 --> 00:01:06.083
whose mind is uncontrolled.

14
00:01:06.083 --> 00:01:07.541
But my opinion is this –

15
00:01:07.541 --> 00:01:08.958
that those who have learned

16
00:01:08.958 --> 00:01:10.500
to bring the mind under control,

17
00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:11.250
and yogis who

18
00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:14.708
make effort with the help of proper means,

19
00:01:14.708 --> 00:01:15.458
they can definitely

20
00:01:15.458 --> 00:01:18.125
attain perfection in yoga.

21
00:01:18.125 --> 00:01:20.125
In the previous verse, Lord Krishna,

22
00:01:20.125 --> 00:01:21.416
understanding Arjuna's mental state,

23
00:01:21.416 --> 00:01:22.625
had accepted

24
00:01:22.625 --> 00:01:25.875
that this path is difficult,

25
00:01:25.875 --> 00:01:27.166
but definitely possible

26
00:01:27.166 --> 00:01:30.166
with practice and detachment.

27
00:01:30.166 --> 00:01:32.500
Lord Krishna is realistic,

28
00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:35.541
because he is not denying Arjuna's doubt,

29
00:01:35.541 --> 00:01:38.833
but is suggesting the right solution.

30
00:01:38.833 --> 00:01:42.833
Now here he is encouraging Arjuna by saying

31
00:01:42.833 --> 00:01:45.083
that yoga is difficult for those people

32
00:01:45.083 --> 00:01:47.250
whose mind is uncontrolled.

33
00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:50.375
The indirect meaning of this is only this –

34
00:01:50.375 --> 00:01:53.583
'Arjuna, you are not like those people.'

35
00:01:53.583 --> 00:01:55.125
Then he says that one who

36
00:01:55.125 --> 00:01:58.041
makes effort with the help of proper means

37
00:01:58.041 --> 00:01:59.833
and brings the mind under control,

38
00:01:59.833 --> 00:02:02.750
that yogi will definitely attain perfection.

39
00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:06.208
Meaning, this is the signal for Arjuna –

40
00:02:06.208 --> 00:02:07.375
that if you adopt proper

41
00:02:07.375 --> 00:02:11.416
means, perfection will definitely be attained.

42
00:02:11.416 --> 00:02:14.291
Lord Krishna is realistic for this reason too –

43
00:02:14.291 --> 00:02:16.458
because he himself is accepting

44
00:02:16.458 --> 00:02:19.250
that for this progress time will be needed,

45
00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:23.125
and patience and right
 method must be adopted.

46
00:02:23.125 --> 00:02:25.666
Along with encouragement,

47
00:02:25.666 --> 00:02:28.583
he is also saying to exercise caution.

48
00:02:28.583 --> 00:02:29.583
Firm resolve 

49
00:02:29.583 --> 00:02:32.666
and practice can't be neglected at all,

50
00:02:32.666 --> 00:02:34.791
and without complete surrender, spiritual

51
00:02:34.791 --> 00:02:36.833
advancement is impossible.

52
00:02:36.833 --> 00:02:39.625
This teaching is not limited only to yoga,

53
00:02:39.625 --> 00:02:42.500
but is important for every spiritual practice.

54
00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:44.000
And along with Arjuna,

55
00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:44.875
this verse

56
00:02:44.875 --> 00:02:48.083
is for all of us too.

57
00:02:48.083 --> 00:02:49.791
Meditation, surrender,

58
00:02:49.791 --> 00:02:52.500
and detachment from unnecessary things –

59
00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:56.250
this is the key to success in life.

60
00:03:00.958 --> 00:03:02.583
Many people,

61
00:03:02.583 --> 00:03:06.666
instead of taking responsibility for their failure,

62
00:03:06.666 --> 00:03:10.583
only believe in blame-placing.

63
00:03:10.583 --> 00:03:12.583
Sometimes they blame circumstances,

64
00:03:12.583 --> 00:03:16.500
sometimes others, and then sometimes

65
00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:21.291
they start declaring themselves guilty.

66
00:03:21.291 --> 00:03:24.166
Those people forget this –

67
00:03:24.166 --> 00:03:28.291
that finding someone guilty for failure

68
00:03:28.291 --> 00:03:30.333
is useless.

69
00:03:30.333 --> 00:03:32.166
What's appropriate is that

70
00:03:32.166 --> 00:03:36.000
the right solution be found.

71
00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:38.208
And for solution,

72
00:03:38.208 --> 00:03:41.666
first it must be known

73
00:03:41.666 --> 00:03:45.500
what the problem is.

74
00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:48.750
The root problem is

75
00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:51.541
this mind,

76
00:03:51.541 --> 00:03:53.791
which wanders,

77
00:03:53.791 --> 00:03:57.500
doesn't remain concentrated toward the goal.

78
00:03:57.500 --> 00:04:00.125
Trying to achieve success with an uncontrolled mind

79
00:04:00.125 --> 00:04:04.250
is exactly like

80
00:04:04.250 --> 00:04:09.166
filling water in a pot

81
00:04:09.166 --> 00:04:11.666
that has many holes.

82
00:04:11.666 --> 00:04:15.875
All the hard work will fail,

83
00:04:15.875 --> 00:04:19.500
because the water will flow away

84
00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:21.000
before being collected.

85
00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:24.333
Success will never be achieved.

86
00:04:24.333 --> 00:04:25.958
For success,

87
00:04:25.958 --> 00:04:28.708
this mind must be kept controlled.

88
00:04:28.708 --> 00:04:31.916
As I told Arjuna,

89
00:04:31.916 --> 00:04:35.541
I tell you the same –

90
00:04:35.541 --> 00:04:39.916
this control is definitely difficult,
 but not impossible.

91
00:04:39.916 --> 00:04:44.250
For this, first what's needed is awareness

92
00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:47.125
and continuous practice –

93
00:04:47.125 --> 00:04:52.666
staying aware, recognize that
 the mind is wandering.

94
00:04:52.666 --> 00:04:55.583
And whenever it wanders,

95
00:04:55.583 --> 00:04:59.458
bring it back again and focus it on the goal.

96
00:04:59.458 --> 00:05:01.958
Whenever the mind starts wandering,

97
00:05:01.958 --> 00:05:05.791
this process must be repeated again and again.

98
00:05:05.791 --> 00:05:08.166
And second thing –

99
00:05:08.166 --> 00:05:11.041
must stay away from habits

100
00:05:11.041 --> 00:05:16.208
and things that make the mind unstable.

101
00:05:16.208 --> 00:05:20.208
Many things will disturb your attention –

102
00:05:20.208 --> 00:05:22.000
some material desire,

103
00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:24.750
jealousy from someone else's progress,

104
00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:28.416
some entertaining program, etc.

105
00:05:28.416 --> 00:05:31.708
Whatever thing disturbs attention,

106
00:05:31.708 --> 00:05:34.416
must remain free from it.

107
00:05:34.416 --> 00:05:39.333
Only from this will purification
 of the mind happen and it

108
00:05:39.333 --> 00:05:40.791
will remain concentrated.

109
00:05:40.791 --> 00:05:42.000
Remember,

110
00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:46.208
success doesn't come only from hard work.

111
00:05:46.208 --> 00:05:47.166
Because without

112
00:05:47.166 --> 00:05:50.541
concentration, all hard work

113
00:05:50.541 --> 00:05:52.416
will become useless.

114
00:05:52.416 --> 00:05:55.708
On the other hand,

115
00:05:55.708 --> 00:06:01.541
even every small effort made
 with a controlled mind

116
00:06:01.541 --> 00:06:04.125
will take you toward the goal, step by step.

117
00:06:08.458 --> 00:06:10.958
Family relationships are also a kind of yoga –

118
00:06:10.958 --> 00:06:13.916
Where on one hand yoga 
connects with Paramātmā,

119
00:06:13.916 --> 00:06:16.625
family relationships

120
00:06:16.625 --> 00:06:20.250
connect people with each other.

121
00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:23.333
And just as in yoga,

122
00:06:23.333 --> 00:06:26.083
control of the mind is necessary,

123
00:06:26.083 --> 00:06:29.833
similarly in family relationships too,

124
00:06:29.833 --> 00:06:30.875
for sweetness,

125
00:06:30.875 --> 00:06:35.208
keeping restraint of the 
mind is extremely necessary.

126
00:06:35.208 --> 00:06:38.458
If the mind became restless,

127
00:06:38.458 --> 00:06:41.875
then a person, ignoring family,

128
00:06:41.875 --> 00:06:45.166
will run after material desires,

129
00:06:45.166 --> 00:06:48.375
and instead of understanding
 others' perspective,

130
00:06:48.375 --> 00:06:52.250
will be stubborn about their own perspective.

131
00:06:52.250 --> 00:06:54.750
From this very thing arises ego

132
00:06:54.750 --> 00:06:57.875
and tension,

133
00:06:57.875 --> 00:07:01.916
which pour bitterness into relationships.

134
00:07:01.916 --> 00:07:04.458
Think yourself –

135
00:07:04.458 --> 00:07:07.166
can relationships be sweet

136
00:07:07.166 --> 00:07:09.291
in such a family?

137
00:07:09.291 --> 00:07:12.791
Where in people's minds there's dissatisfaction?

138
00:07:12.791 --> 00:07:15.166
In minds there are numerous thoughts.

139
00:07:15.166 --> 00:07:19.375
Countless expectations from each other.

140
00:07:19.375 --> 00:07:20.541
In such an environment,

141
00:07:20.541 --> 00:07:25.166
discord and distances increase.

142
00:07:25.166 --> 00:07:30.666
Small things become a big dispute.

143
00:07:30.666 --> 00:07:31.958
On the other hand,

144
00:07:31.958 --> 00:07:34.708
if all family members

145
00:07:34.708 --> 00:07:38.916
try to keep their mind in restraint,

146
00:07:38.916 --> 00:07:41.750
then even the biggest dispute

147
00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:44.375
will be avoided peacefully.

148
00:07:44.375 --> 00:07:46.541
When the mind is controlled

149
00:07:46.541 --> 00:07:51.291
and free from ego, only then can

150
00:07:51.291 --> 00:07:56.291
mutual love and trust be born.

151
00:07:56.291 --> 00:07:59.458
Mutual relationships also, like yoga,

152
00:07:59.458 --> 00:08:02.875
demand continuous practice.

153
00:08:02.875 --> 00:08:07.041
Every day small efforts must be made.

154
00:08:07.041 --> 00:08:10.500
If bitterness starts arising in the mind,

155
00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:11.625
then with effort

156
00:08:11.625 --> 00:08:16.708
and mutual conversation, this
 bitterness must be erased.

157
00:08:16.708 --> 00:08:19.875
Must listen to each other's words,

158
00:08:19.875 --> 00:08:21.500
must understand,

159
00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:24.083
must remain connected together.

160
00:08:24.083 --> 00:08:25.833
Yoga's perspective

161
00:08:25.833 --> 00:08:29.666
not only makes personal life beautiful,

162
00:08:29.666 --> 00:08:33.500
but also binds the family

163
00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:37.750
with intimacy and emotions.

164
00:08:42.208 --> 00:08:47.458
Success in professional life also,
 like yoga, depends

165
00:08:47.458 --> 00:08:51.958
on concentration and discipline.

166
00:08:51.958 --> 00:08:55.166
Therefore gaining control over the mind

167
00:08:55.166 --> 00:08:58.875
is not only essential for yoga, but

168
00:08:58.875 --> 00:09:00.375
this is also necessary

169
00:09:00.375 --> 00:09:01.791
for the progress of

170
00:09:01.791 --> 00:09:04.375
your professional life.

171
00:09:04.375 --> 00:09:09.583
If the mind remains unstable,
 attention will wander.

172
00:09:09.583 --> 00:09:12.208
Forgetting the goal,

173
00:09:12.208 --> 00:09:15.958
you'll be attracted toward unnecessary things.

174
00:09:15.958 --> 00:09:18.333
Instead of making right decisions,

175
00:09:18.333 --> 00:09:22.791
you'll start getting entangled in useless ego.

176
00:09:22.791 --> 00:09:27.375
If results don't happen according
 to your expectations,

177
00:09:27.375 --> 00:09:29.875
then despair will grip you.

178
00:09:29.875 --> 00:09:31.666
From all these,

179
00:09:31.666 --> 00:09:33.416
negative impact will fall

180
00:09:33.416 --> 00:09:36.083
on your work capacity,

181
00:09:36.083 --> 00:09:37.875
mistakes will increase,

182
00:09:37.875 --> 00:09:41.625
and your progress will slow down.

183
00:09:41.625 --> 00:09:45.000
For example, if the mind remained unstable,

184
00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:49.208
then today you'll be attracted toward one goal,

185
00:09:49.208 --> 00:09:51.958
tomorrow toward some other goal.

186
00:09:51.958 --> 00:09:54.500
This is like

187
00:09:54.500 --> 00:10:00.625
your chariot's horses are pulling
 in different directions.

188
00:10:00.625 --> 00:10:02.666
Such a chariot

189
00:10:02.666 --> 00:10:04.375
won't be able to go anywhere.

190
00:10:04.375 --> 00:10:07.625
Therefore, in professional life too,

191
00:10:07.625 --> 00:10:11.916
like in yoga, continuous practice
 of keeping the mind

192
00:10:11.916 --> 00:10:15.208
focused must be done.

193
00:10:15.208 --> 00:10:19.125
Many momentary benefits will attract you,

194
00:10:19.125 --> 00:10:22.750
unethical desires will also come to mind...

195
00:10:22.750 --> 00:10:25.708
but by practicing repeatedly,

196
00:10:25.708 --> 00:10:29.458
removing the mind from all these, every time

197
00:10:29.458 --> 00:10:33.708
it must be focused on your main goal.

198
00:10:33.708 --> 00:10:36.750
Along with this, like in yoga,

199
00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:40.500
distance must be kept from unnecessary things,

200
00:10:40.500 --> 00:10:44.125
this detachment is extremely necessary.

201
00:10:44.125 --> 00:10:45.958
For example,

202
00:10:45.958 --> 00:10:49.708
ego only brings loss.

203
00:10:49.708 --> 00:10:52.916
professional relationships deteriorate.

204
00:10:52.916 --> 00:10:56.458
So if there's some difference of opinion,

205
00:10:56.458 --> 00:11:01.708
then distance must be kept 
from useless mentality like ego.

206
00:11:01.708 --> 00:11:05.500
All this will provide you stability.

207
00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:09.875
Will save your hard work
 from becoming useless.

208
00:11:09.875 --> 00:11:14.541
You'll become more capable
 of making right decisions.

209
00:11:14.541 --> 00:11:18.375
And this very continuous practice

210
00:11:18.375 --> 00:11:20.250
will take you toward progress.
